Subject: Connect builtin UAPI6 to the existing GKI SUSFS contracts

Target: SukiSU builtin 1cfa57340590971cba7521ed536da8ebbedc5f0a.
The paired SELinux parser is upstream already. Keep it and the sehide1 GKI
callers; restore global linkage and the existing GKI AV helper wrappers.
Match sucompat's static-key ABI and expose the PID1 preinit entry point.
Apply with 51_fix_selinux_timing_gki_android15_6.6.patch and 52 below.

